From: Scott Miller <152090551+seelesturm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:32:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] test(mcp): synchronize active-client idle refresh checks

Queue complete messages before releasing each owner reply. Check eight successful exchanges beyond two idle windows, then require the same connection to expire after activity stops.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3230
